      "title": "Thoughts To Nostr",
      "content_html": "\u003cp\u003eI am trying to use \u003ca href=\"/temporal/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"temporal\" data-description=\"Temporal is a workflow orchestrator that I\u0026#39;m interested in\" data-date=\"2025-06-24\" data-preview=\"Temporal is a workflow orchestrator that I\u0026#39;m interested in\"\u003etemporal\u003c/a\u003e at home for running automated pipelines. It\u0026rsquo;s\ndefinitely overkill for my use case but this is America\u0026hellip;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo my first project is a system that takes my \u003ca href=\"/thoughts/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"Thoughts\" data-description=\"My thoughts are found at my thoughts feed\" data-date=\"2025-06-09\" data-preview=\"My thoughts are found at my thoughts feed\"\u003eThoughts\u003c/a\u003e and posts them to\n\u003ca href=\"/nostr/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"Nostr\" data-description=\"???+ note \u0026#34;How to start...\u0026#34;\" data-date=\"2025-07-02\" data-preview=\"???+ note \u0026#34;How to start...\u0026#34;\"\u003eNostr\u003c/a\u003e as I briefly discussed in \u003ca href=\"/testing-a-postiz-change-locally/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"Testing a Postiz Change Locally (IT WORKS!)\" data-description=\"I am working on a pipeline at home to integrate my blog with social media a little more. One of the things I want to do is automatically post my-thoughts to...\" data-date=\"2025-07-06\" data-preview=\"I am working on a pipeline at home to integrate my blog with social media a little more. One of the things I want to do is automatically post my-thoughts to...\"\u003eTesting a Postiz Change Locally (IT WORKS!)\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI have temporal infrastructure setup in homelab-compose and then\nhomelab-temporal should probably be homelab-temporal-pipelines or something,\nbut it\u0026rsquo;s the app code. I also have a repo homelab-social-media-pipelines -\nwhich has been consolidated down into homelab-temporal. once that all works I\ncan destroy the homelab-social-media-pipelines repo\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNOTE: everything is moving to homelab-mono\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"issue-01\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-wear-glyph\"\u003eIssue 01\u003c/span\u003e \u003ca href=\"#issue-01\" class=\"heading-anchor\"\u003e#\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am currently hitting a stupid python issue:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cpre\u003e\u003ccode\u003enic in homelab-temporal   main    ×2  ×4  ×7 via   v3.12.8(homelab-temporal)   (dev) 󰒄\n⬢ [devbox] ❯ python -c \u0026quot;from homelab_temporal.postiz.postiz_client import PostizClient\u0026quot;\n(homelab-temporal)\nnic in homelab-temporal   main    ×2  ×4  ×7 via   v3.12.8(homelab-temporal)   (dev) 󰒄\n⬢ [devbox] ❯ python scripts/postiz/simple_post.py\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \u0026quot;/home/nic/projects/personal/homelab-temporal/scripts/postiz/simple_post.py\u0026quot;, line 3, in \u0026lt;module\u0026gt;\n    from homelab_temporal.postiz.postiz_client import PostizClient, process_for_nostr, process_for_x\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'homelab_temporal'\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003cp\u003every dumb venv problem\u0026hellip;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"resolution\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-wear-glyph\"\u003eResolution\u003c/span\u003e \u003ca href=\"#resolution\" class=\"heading-anchor\"\u003e#\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eneed to use \u003ccode\u003epython -m\u003c/code\u003e because the script is outside the project root? see \u003ca href=\"/2025-07-08-notes/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"2025-07-08 Notes\" data-description=\"Today I consolidated homelab-social-media-pipelines into homelab-temporal, which is the app repo.\" data-date=\"2025-07-08\" data-preview=\"Today I consolidated homelab-social-media-pipelines into homelab-temporal, which is the app repo.\"\u003e2025-07-08 Notes\u003c/a\u003e and the chatgpt notes for more on this but it works now\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"thoughts-order\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-wear-glyph\"\u003eThoughts Order\u003c/span\u003e \u003ca href=\"#thoughts-order\" class=\"heading-anchor\"\u003e#\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eas of \u003ca href=\"/2025-07-11-notes/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"2025-07-11 Notes\" data-description=\"yesterday 2025-07-10-notes\" data-date=\"2025-07-11\" data-preview=\"yesterday 2025-07-10-notes\"\u003e2025-07-11 Notes\u003c/a\u003e I have the thoughts ordering correct - we post the oldest thoughts up to the newest ones. Now I want more intros for the notes so they don\u0026rsquo;t get too repetitive\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"todos\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-wear-glyph\"\u003eTODOs\u003c/span\u003e \u003ca href=\"#todos\" class=\"heading-anchor\"\u003e#\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e[x] - destroy the homelab-social-media-pipelines repo\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e[] - think about how to structure things more\u0026hellip; monorepo in homelab-temporal might be hard to manage with AI tools due to context management\u0026hellip; unsure though\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e[] - create workflow and activities for thoughts to nostr\u0026hellip; revisit diagram to see what you need to build out in the temporal repo\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e[] - do something like this for github stars and then blog posts\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI need to update my templates for nostr og images using this as fodder\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cpre class=\"chroma\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"c\"\u003e\u0026lt;!-- HTML Meta Tags --\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nt\"\u003etitle\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003eNostr Design\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e\u0026lt;/\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nt\"\u003etitle\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nt\"\u003emeta\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003ename\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;description\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003econtent\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;A comprehensive resource for designers and developers to build successful nostr products\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e/\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"c\"\u003e\u0026lt;!-- Facebook Meta Tags --\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nt\"\u003emeta\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003eproperty\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;og:url\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003econtent\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;https://nostrdesign.org\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e/\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nt\"\u003emeta\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003eproperty\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;og:type\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003econtent\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;website\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e/\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nt\"\u003emeta\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003eproperty\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;og:title\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003econtent\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;Nostr Design\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e/\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nt\"\u003emeta\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003eproperty\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;og:description\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003econtent\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;A comprehensive resource for designers and developers to build successful nostr products\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e/\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nt\"\u003emeta\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003eproperty\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;og:image\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003econtent\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;https://nostrdesign.org/img/nostr-cover.jpg\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e/\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"c\"\u003e\u0026lt;!-- Twitter Meta Tags --\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nt\"\u003emeta\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003ename\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;twitter:card\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"na\"\u003econtent\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s\"\u003e\u0026#34;summary_large_image\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e/\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u0